From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:39:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 40/86] Folding and column selection: review fixes

- A multi-row column paste unfolds the lines below the block it writes to.
- Reloading unchanged text (the watcher after each own save) keeps folds.
- is_fold_header: O(1) check for drawing and hit tests instead of
  walking the whole fold per header per frame.
- Change mark clicks and column widths skip hidden rows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

